<title>GREECE: KATSANIS GOES TO STATE NATIONAL BANK OF GREECE.</title>
<headline>KATSANIS GOES TO STATE NATIONAL BANK OF GREECE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Christos Katsanis, former manager at the Sofia branch of private Xiosbank and high-level official at Euromerchant Balkan Fund, joined state National Bank of Greece, a market source said.</p>
<p>Katsanis will be regional manager for National Bank's branches in the Balkans, the source said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
